{# Style Bible Prompt v1 #}
{# Generates a structured art style guide from the World Bible entities. #}

You are an Art Director for a dark fantasy illustrated book. Study the World Bible below and create a comprehensive Style Bible that will ensure every illustration in this book has a consistent, cohesive visual identity.

WORLD BIBLE (entities and tone):
{{ bible_summary }}

TASK: Design the visual language for this world. Every image generated for this book will use this Style Bible as its foundation.

Output valid JSON matching this schema exactly:

{
  "art_style": {
    "palette": "Describe the color palette as a single string. Include dominant colors, accent colors, saturation levels, and any special color rules (e.g., 'desaturated earth tones, cold blue shadows, rare crimson accents for magical elements')",
    "lighting": "Describe the lighting style. Time of day preference, light source direction, shadow quality, contrast ratio (e.g., 'low-key chiaroscuro, single visible light source, deep shadows at frame edges')",
    "composition": "Describe composition rules. Subject placement, use of negative space, depth of field, perspective preference (e.g., 'character off-center facing into negative space, environmental storytelling in background details')",
    "linework": "Describe the line art style. Ink quality, edge treatment, detail density, whether lines are visible or painted (e.g., 'visible ink hatching, rough painterly edges, no clean vector lines')",
    "mood": "Describe the emotional quality. Single string capturing the dominant atmosphere (e.g., 'melancholy, ancient, foreboding, moments of eerie beauty')",
    "forbidden": ["List 5-10 elements that must NEVER appear: modern technology, specific art styles, inappropriate moods, etc."]
  },
  "character_design": {
{% for char in characters %}
    "{{ char.id }}": "1-2 sentence visual description capturing: face, build, clothing, distinctive features, typical posture/expression"{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
  },
  "location_palettes": {
{% for loc in locations %}
    "{{ loc.id }}": "1 sentence visual description capturing: dominant colors, atmosphere, lighting quality, distinctive environmental features"{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
  }
}

CRITICAL RULES:
1. The art_style must match the world's tone: {{ tone }}.
2. Every character in the bible MUST have a character_design entry using their exact id.
3. Every location in the bible MUST have a location_palettes entry using their exact id.
4. The palette and lighting must work together — if the world is dark fantasy, don't use bright daylight.
5. The forbidden list must be thorough. Common exclusions: "modern clothing", "neon colors", "clean environments", "smiling figures", "text", "UI elements", "photorealism", "3d render", "anime style".
6. Character designs should be descriptive enough that Stable Diffusion can render them consistently across scenes, but concise (1-2 sentences each).
7. Output ONLY the JSON object. No markdown, no explanatory text.
